<title>USA: Coral Springs, Fla. won by William R. Hough.</title>
<headline>Coral Springs, Fla. won by William R. Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R. Hough said it won</p>
<p>$28.085 million of Coral Springs, Fla., franchise refunding</p>
<p>revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of</p>
<p>5.34 percent.</p>
</text>
